t management) beyond the general VKSA information, schedule a field visit with the KVK agronomist or your extension officer.  \n  2. If the sensor node remains offline after troubleshooting, request on‑site technical assistance to avoid data gaps.", "claims": ["supported: Active alert: Node offline for 49530 minutes", "supported: Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA‑2025) was launched in Karnataka on 8 June 2025 at ICAR‑IIHR, Bengaluru", "supported: The VKSA programme is being implemented in Karnataka", "supported: The state launch confirms local farmers can access VKSA outreach activities through the KVK network and extension channels"], "unsupported": [], "final_answer": "**Observation:**  \n- Active alert: [critical] Node offline (no contact for 49530 min).  \n- Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA‑2025) was launched in Karnataka on 8 June 2025 at ICAR‑IIHR, Bengaluru (as per agricultural knowledge).  \n\n**Analysis:**  \nThe VKSA programme is indeed being implemented in Karnataka; the state launch confirms that local farmers can access its outreach activities through the KVK network and related extension channels.  \n\n**Confidence:** High – the launch date and location are explicitly documented.  \n\n**Recommendations:**  \n- **Immediate actions:**  \n  1. Contact your nearest Krishi Vigyan Kendra (KVK) to learn about upcoming VKSA sessions or materials for sugarcane growers.  \n  2. Report the node‑offline alert to the farm’s technical support team to restore sensor communication.  \n\n- **Monitoring advice:**  \n  1. Keep track of KVK announcements (SMS, notice boards, local radio) for VKSA workshops, especially those focused on soil health and sugarcane management.  \n  2. Once the sensor node is back online, regularly review temperature, humidity, and soil‑moisture data to complement VKSA recommendations.  \n\n- **When to seek expert help:**  \n  1. If you need detailed, crop‑specific guidance (e.g., nutrient plans, pest management) beyond the general VKSA information, schedule a field visit with the KVK agronomist or your extension officer.  \n  2. If the sensor node remains offline after troubleshooting, request on‑site technical assistance to avoid data gaps.", "fact_check": "checked", "fact_check_seconds": 0.98, "groq_calls": [{"purpose": "rewrite", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 204, "completion_tokens": 29, "seconds": 0.67, "status": "ok", "seq": 13}, {"purpose": "answer", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "prompt_tokens": 1366, "completion_tokens": 685, "seconds": 1.9, "status": "ok", "seq": 14}, {"purpose": "fact_check", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "prompt_tokens": 1059, "completion_tokens": 445, "seconds": 0.98, "status": "ok", "seq": 15}]}
