lication: 7–8 cm.\n\n# CONVERSATION MEMORY (recent turns, for context)\nFarmer: ಪ್ರತಿ irrigation ಗೆ ಎಷ್ಟು cm water ಹಾಕ್ಬೇಕು?\nGage (earlier, shortened): ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ಮುಂದುವರಿಯುವ ಮೊದಲು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ: \"If soil moisture <30% increase irrigation to 8 cm\" (Gage ಮಾಹಿತಿ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಇಲ್ಲ); \"If soil moisture >35% keep irrigation at 7 cm\" (Gage ಮಾಹಿತಿ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಇಲ್ಲ); \"Node repair involves checking power, ...\nFarmer: VKSA ಅಂತ ಒಂದು programme ಇದೆ ಅಂತ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದೀನಿ, ನಮ್ಮ ಕರ್ನಾಟಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತಾ?\nGage (earlier, shortened): **Observation:** - Active alert: [critical] Node offline (no contact for 49530 min). - Viksit Krishi Sankalp Abhiyan (VKSA‑2025) was launched in Karnataka on 8 June 2025 at ICAR‑IIHR, Bengaluru (as per agricultural knowledge). ...\nFarmer: ನಾನು ಯಾವ ಕಬ್ಬಿನ ತಳಿ ಹಾಕೊಬೇಕು ಅಂತ confuse ಆಗಿದೀನಿ, ಸರಿಯಾದ variety ಹೇಗೆ ಆರಿಸ್ಕೊಳಿ ಅಂತ ಹೇಳಿ.\nGage (earlier, shortened): ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ಮುಂದುವರಿಯುವ ಮೊದಲು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ: \"I don't have enough evidence from the latest observation\" (Gage ಮಾಹಿತಿ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಇಲ್ಲ); \"Missing: current crop growth stage (days after planting)\" (Gage ಮಾಹಿತಿ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಇಲ್ಲ); \"Missing: soil ...\n\n# USER QUESTION\nSir every time watering how much depth I give, any standard number?", "farmer": "Sir every time watering how much depth I give, any standard number?"}, "retrieval_methods": {"original": "Sir every time watering how much depth I give, any standard number?", "sarvam": "Sir, every time watering, how much depth I give, any standard number?", "groq": "sugarcane irrigation depth standard depth per watering cycle"}, "retrieval_best_by_method": {"original": 0.8554, "sarvam": 0.8574, "groq": 0.9266}, "retrieved": [{"source": "irrigation/01_irrigation_water_management.md", "section": "Sugarcane Irrigation Water Management — Main Information", "score": 0.9266, "via": "groq"}, {"source": "sugarcane/02_land_preparation.md", "section": "Land Preparation for Sugarcane Cultivation — Key Facts", "score": 0.9053, "via": "groq"}, {"source": "irrigation/01_irrigation_water_manag